/E (Infant mortality is the death of an infant before their first birthday. The Infant Mortality Rate measures the number of deaths per 1,000 live births for infants within their first year of life. The infant mortality rate in the United States is higher than in other high-income countries. 3,8,9)
/Pg 14 0 R
