/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 476 0 R
/E (In addition to safe sleep education, new and expecting families need a system of support around them to maintain well-being. A Community Asset and Resource Map is a visual representation of identified places in a community that can promote positive change.31 This map displays resources in Rutherford County that promotes well-being, addresses barriers for new and expecting families, and facilitates better collaboration. Furthermore, this map was created within Google Maps so that families can navigate to these resources, conveniently and when they need it most, using an app they are already familiar with.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1 1250 0 R 2]
>>
endobj
