/P 476 0 R
/E (To initiate the mapping process, a set of search terms and associated modifiers were identified. These terms were chosen based on previous knowledge gleaned from maternal health research and insights provided by the 2021 Community Health Assessment \(CHA\) for Rutherford County. The selection aimed to capture a comprehensive range of maternal and infant health resources available within the county. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [19]
>>
